Package: libxshmfence1
Version: @DEB_LIBXSHMFENCE_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/lib/libxshmfence
Description: X shared-memory fences library
 libxshmfence exposes a small API for shared-memory fences used by the X SYNC
 extension. Built for iOS with the portable pthread backend and mkstemp-based
 shared memory (no futex / memfd on Darwin). A link dependency of Xwayland.
